phases.prompt_template:
Execute the Hunting Buddy Sovereign Camp Tactical Briefing workflow.

INPUTS:
- Camp / Property: {{params.camp | (active camp)}} (property_id: {{params.property_id | 1}})
- Active Wind Scenario: {{params.wind_deg | 315}}° @ {{params.wind_mph | 8}} mph (thermal: {{params.thermal_mode | neutral}})
- Output artifact path: {{result_path}}

FIFO PRE-FLIGHT TELEMETRY & VISUAL MAP (already computed concurrently in Phase 1 — ALL `+hunting` tools + `vision_analyze` are ALREADY mounted on Turn 1, do NOT call `tool_search`):
- Pre-Flight Rendered Hybrid Satellite Map PNG (satellite imagery, parcel lines, 1m LiDAR contours, traced streams/trails, stands & scent cones): {{phase.preflight_gis_weather.preflight_map}}
- Stand & Scent Cone Physics: {{phase.preflight_gis_weather.scent_plan}}
- Live Weather (`current_conditions` = RIGHT NOW, `key_hunting_windows` = upcoming dawn/evening sits — use `current_conditions`, NOT midnight `hourly[0]`!): {{phase.preflight_gis_weather.weather}}
- Topographic Elevation, Slope Drainage & Landmarks (water sources, ridges, saddles): {{phase.preflight_gis_weather.topo}}
- Traced Streams, Walking Trails, Driving Roads & Deer Trails: {{phase.preflight_gis_weather.routes}}

MANDATORY EXECUTION STEPS (call your already-mounted tools directly):
1. **Visual Map Inspection First:** If `preflight_map.png_path` exists, call `vision_analyze` on `preflight_map.png_path` to visually read the real satellite habitat — timber edges, swamp/marsh transitions, openings/clearings, creek bends, funnels, terrain contours, parcel boundaries, and where scent cones blow relative to cover.
2. Combine your visual satellite findings with Phase 1 `current_conditions`, `key_hunting_windows`, stand scores, scent cones, downwind conflicts, LiDAR elevation relief, thermal drainage direction, traced trails/streams, and landmarks (only call `hunt_topo` with action='fetch_dem' if `has_dem` is false).
3. Call `hunt_plan_save` (action="save", plan_mode="hunt", property_id={{params.property_id | 1}}) with your **FULL, COMPLETE tactical hunting plan** in `briefing_markdown` (NEVER a 1-sentence stub!) AND place 2-5 removable tactical map annotations (`stand_pick`, `approach_route`, `avoid_zone`, `pinch_point`, `bedding_zone`) derived from real coordinates with specific `notes` explaining WHY each spot works. WAIT for `hunt_plan_save` to return its integer `plan_id` before writing `{{result_path}}`.
4. Call `hunt_render_map` (property_id={{params.property_id | 1}}, wind_deg={{params.wind_deg | 315}}, wind_mph={{params.wind_mph | 8}}, thermal_mode="{{params.thermal_mode | neutral}}", basemap="hybrid", publish_discord=false) so the final static tactical map PNG renders with your newly placed annotations.
5. Write structured JSON to `{{result_path}}` via `file_write` with keys:
   `workflow`, `plan_id` (the exact integer returned by `hunt_plan_save`), `plan_mode` (`"hunt"`), `camp_name`, `wind_summary`, `shooting_light`, `top_stands`, `blown_stands`, `annotations`, `map_path`, and `briefing_markdown` (**MUST contain the FULL multi-section markdown report — NOT a short summary!**).
6. Call `milestone_complete` and deliver a concise deer-camp tactical briefing suitable for hunters heading out.
